# ABP Options Pattern

## Configuring Options
Configure options in your module's `ConfigureServices`:

```csharp
public override void ConfigureServices(ServiceConfigurationContext context)
{
    Configure<MyOptions>(options =>
    {
        options.Value1 = 42;
        options.EnableFeature = true;
    });
}
```

## Getting Option Values
```csharp
public class MyService : ITransientDependency
{
    private readonly MyOptions _options;

    public MyService(IOptions<MyOptions> options)
    {
        _options = options.Value;
    }
}
```

## Pre-Configuration
For options needed during DI registration, use `PreConfigure`:

```csharp
public override void PreConfigureServices(ServiceConfigurationContext context)
{
    PreConfigure<MyPreOptions>(options =>
    {
        options.MyValue = true;
    });
}

public override void ConfigureServices(ServiceConfigurationContext context)
{
    var options = context.Services.ExecutePreConfiguredActions<MyPreOptions>();
    if (options.MyValue)
    {
        // Configure services based on pre-configured value
    }
}
```
